    "statement": "\n    {Ω : Type*} [MeasurableSpace Ω] (μ : Measure Ω)\n    (A B : Lp ℝ 2 μ →L[ℝ] Lp ℝ 2 μ)\n    (hA : A.IsPositive) (hB : B.IsPositive)\n    (hSquareOrder : (B*B-A*A).IsPositive) :\n    (B-A).IsPositive",
    "statement_sha256": "099c95a5d4d4a160e2c18943755e58e8e89dc87e2dbe95922582504dee961491",
    "compiled": true,
    "formalizer": "root-samplinglib-writer",
